[{:adr/authoritative_for ["cloud-itonami-iso3166-usa-* agency-level scope (15 curated)"], :adr/topic "cloud-itonami-iso3166-usa-agency-level-extension", :adr/related ["adr-2607040100-cloud-itonami-iso3166-jpn-agency-level-extension" "adr-2607105500-cloud-itonami-iso3166-usa-chn-implemented"], :adr/status "accepted", :adr/id "adr-2607105600-cloud-itonami-iso3166-usa-agency-level-extension", :adr/doc_type "adr", :adr/body "# ADR-2607105600: cloud-itonami-iso3166-usa — agency-level extension (15 curated federal bodies)\n\n**Status**: accepted\n**Date**: 2026-07-10\n\n## Context\n\nADR-2607040100 validated Japan agency depth (19/19). Future work asked for\nUSA depth, deliberately scoped — the full U.S. federal org chart is far\nlarger than Japan's 19-body mapping.\n\n## Decision\n\nAdd a **deliberate 15-body** USA agency level under parent `USA`:\n\n| Type | Bodies |\n|---|---|\n| agency | GSA, SBA |\n| ministry (cabinet dept) | TREASURY, DOC, DOD, DHS, DOL, HHS, DOT, DOE, VA |\n| independent-commission | EPA, FTC, SEC, FCC |\n\nEach gets `cloud-itonami-iso3166-usa-{slug}` blueprint at `:blueprint`,\nwith `:ooyake-id` `gov.usa.*` cross-reference (naming parallel to Japan).\n\n`kotoba.iso3166/children \"USA\"` returns 15. Other countries remain flat.\n\n## Consequences\n\n- Total registry entries 212 → 227\n- USA is the second country with agency-level depth (after JPN)\n- Not full federal coverage — intentional; expand in later batches", :adr/deciders ["Jun Kawasaki"], :adr/date "2026-07-10", :db/id -1, :adr/decision-summary "{:parent \"USA\", :count 15, :maturity :blueprint, :deliberate-subset true}", :adr/title "ADR-2607105600: cloud-itonami-iso3166-usa — agency-level extension (15 curated federal bodies)", :adr/source-format "edn"}]